   "text": "The desk cable organizer is built as one editable part in a new design, \"Desk cable organizer\". It passed the plan check: 100 x 44 x 37 mm, watertight, 2 mm minimum wall.\n\n- **Hook:** a 12 mm top plate that rests on the desk, with a 4 mm front lip that hangs 25 mm down the desk edge.\n- **Slots:** five 10 mm wide slots, 18 mm apart, 32 mm long and 10 mm deep, leaving a 2 mm floor.\n\nThe 25 mm desk edge is a guess. If your desk edge is a different thickness, tell me and I'll change the lip. The other sizes are common defaults, as you asked. The part is not sliced or sent to the printer yet. When you're ready, I can slice it for your P1S in PLA and queue it after you approve."
